Data privacy law. Say it with me. Data privacy law!

6
00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:34.152
Personal information protection. Say it with me. Personal information protection!

7
00:00:37.653 --> 00:00:42.120
Consent requirement. Say it with me. Consent requirement!

8
00:00:45.665 --> 00:00:51.028
Data collection policy. Say it with me. Data collection policy!

9
00:00:54.544 --> 00:00:58.977
User rights. Say it with me. User rights!

10
00:01:02.472 --> 00:01:06.465
Regulation. Say it with me. Regulation!

11
00:01:09.913 --> 00:01:14.011
Compliance. Say it with me. Compliance!

12
00:01:17.566 --> 00:01:22.783
Privacy by design. Say it with me. Privacy by design!

13
00:01:26.246 --> 00:01:36.830
Data privacy laws protect personal information, often requiring consent for data collection. Regulation and compliance give users rights, supporting privacy by design.

14
