Consent requirement!

17
00:01:48.896 --> 00:01:54.057
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:54.107 --> 00:01:55.279
Compliance!

19
00:01:56.473 --> 00:02:05.336
Did you know? Data privacy laws now exist in many countries, and some give users the legal right to request that a company delete their data!

20
